Author: Wallace Chan <naahtec@hotmail.com>
Date:   Sun Jun 14 01:20:47 2026 -0400

    fix(#12244) P2: address DS review — crash-looping+stop wedge + last_spawn_at gate
    
    Finding 1 (error): a crash-looping agent + operator /stop wedged forever
    (crash-looping is excluded from both is_dead and the resume branch, and
    should_reboot is False for STOPPING). Now an operator stop wins over the
    backoff: crash-looping + STOPPING/STOPPED intent settles to 'stopped' so the
    STOPPING-fulfillment path finishes it. Regression test added.
    
    Finding 2 (warning): auto-reboot path stamped last_spawn_at only when
    terminal_pid was truthy, diverging from the other three spawn paths. Now gated
    on result success to match — a successful spawn always stamps.
    
    197 harness tests pass.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

